WEBVTT

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.720
so that we act more in accordance
with our statistical profiles.

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:35.416
The digital economy --
does it like people?

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:38.336
No, if you have a business plan,
what are you supposed to do?

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:39.616
Get rid of all the people.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:43.040
Human beings, they want health care,
they want money, they want meaning.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.240
You can't scale with people.

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:48.816
(Laughter)

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.056
Even our digital apps --

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:53.296
they don't help us
form any rapport or solidarity.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:55.736
I mean, where's the button
on the ride hailing app

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:59.256
for the drivers to talk to one another
about their working conditions

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.480
or to unionize?